<title>FRANCE: Bomb kills five in Algeria.</title>
<headline>Bomb kills five in Algeria.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1996-11-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>A bomb killed five people on Thursday in a health centre in Boukiou village in western Algeria, security forces said.</p>
<p>In a statement carried on the official news agency APS, the security forces said the bomb had been planted by &quot;criminals&quot;, one of Algeria's official terms for Moslem fundamentalists.</p>
</text>
